# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist).
# The phone's own battery (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.batt23, with the kernel's battery=3): what the
# kernel's power source and powerd have made of it, every 15 seconds, each line kept for the
# dump (kern.redwood.say's "!") -- the kernel prints its own AUXADC line every minute besides.
# While this runs the user plugs a charger in and pulls it out again: the percent, the
# charger bit and the port's VCDT word move with the cable.
/redwood/bin/battery_test 16 15
